        "three-viewport-gizmo@^2.2.0",
        "typescript@^5.5.0",
        "vite@^7.1.4"
      ],
      "docs": "Install dependencies with `pnpm install`, then run `pnpm dev`. The package manifest forces all UIKit packages to use the IWSDK-compatible `npm:super-three@0.181.0`; do not remove the UIKit dependencies, pnpm override, or Vite dedupe settings.",
